{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項最新考古研究顯示，人類社會中財富與地位不平等的形成時間可能比此前認為的更早。研究人員通過分析中歐地區近300座史前墓葬發現，約5000年前的歐洲社會已經出現財富和社會地位逐漸分化的跡象，而這一過程可能最終催生了後來的家族特權和階層傳承制度。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587308.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:04:29.253389+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:38:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:39.011343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:39.011343+00:00","content_hash":"fc6c2d4efa1d53afbbd7b335f000630dd8b77dd0ea5f1e5cf9ff593af8a6a046","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}